			"Message": "style(Echo): Align em-space characters in ecosystem diagram header\n\nReplace the EM SPACE character (U+2003, `&emsp;`) around the `+` separator\nin the `Echo in the Land Ecosystem` diagram heading with an EM QUAD\n(U+2001, `&#x2001;`), matching the surrounding separator characters for\nvisual consistency.\n\nAlso advance the Documentation/Rust submodule by 2 commits, pulling in\nthe latest upstream documentation reference material.",
